			<h3>Booking window 1</h3>
			<p>Dates before the booking window open in grey; pick one inside it, or press <kbd>Page Down</kbd> to move a month (note 1).</p>
		</article>
		<article class="note note-1" data-topic="time-zones">
			<h3>Time zones 2</h3>
			<p>Dates before the booking window open in grey; pick one inside it, or press <kbd>Page Down</kbd> to move a month (note 2).</p>
		</article>
		<article class="note note-2" data-topic="holidays">
			<h3>Holidays 3</h3>
			<p>Dates before the booking window open in grey; pick one inside it, or press <kbd>Page Down</kbd> to move a month (note 3).</p>
